Scope note

This license covers the contents of this repository: the browser-extension
source under src/, its build configuration, and its documentation. It is a
from-scratch client implementation; see docs/LICENSE_AUDIT.md for the audit
establishing that no ASUS or Asuswrt-Merlin source was copied into it.

It does not extend to:

  * The reference source trees kept under RAW/. Those are ASUS and
    Asuswrt-Merlin GPL source, retained locally for analysis, excluded from
    distribution, and governed by their own licenses.

  * ASUS and Asuswrt-Merlin product and feature names, and the setting labels
    this client reuses to identify the native controls it maps to. Those are
    used descriptively and remain the property of their respective owners.
    See docs/LICENSE_AUDIT.md section 3.4.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by ASUSTeK
Computer Inc. or the Asuswrt-Merlin project.
